== connect help ==
Connect an API from an OpenAPI spec URL or file path

Usage:
  musterflow connect <spec-url> [flags]

Flags:
      --auth string       Auth type: none, apikey, bearer, oauth2, mtls (default "none")
  -u, --base-url string   Override base URL for the API
  -h, --help              help for connect
  -n, --name string       Human-readable name for the API
      --tolerate          Repair cosmetic spec defects (bad examples, boolean required, array without items, dangling refs) and connect in a degraded state; off by default

Global Flags:
      --dashboard-addr string   Dashboard HTTP address (default: port from config)
      --data-dir string         Data directory (default: ~/.musterflow)
      --no-dashboard            Force local registry mode (skip dashboard detection)
      --output-file string      Output file path (format auto-detected from extension)
